1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,480
Signhify can export a complete project as a ZIP file.

2
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:07,083
The frontend includes all HTML,

3
00:00:07,083 --> 00:00:09,980
CSS, and JavaScript ready to serve.

4
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:14,480
It also bundles an Express API starter for backend logic.

5
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:17,951
One prompt generates a scroll-reactive site

6
00:00:17,951 --> 00:00:20,980
and a deployable ZIP with both layers.

7
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:23,922
Unzip, npm install, then npm start

8
00:00:23,922 --> 00:00:26,480
to run the full stack locally.

9
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:28,928
Deploy the ZIP to any host, and

10
00:00:28,928 --> 00:00:32,980
the site runs with native scroll parallax instantly.
